<li class="ltx_tocentry ltx_tocentry_appendix"><a href="#A5" title="In LeRobot: An Open-Source Library for End-to-End Robot Learning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_title"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_ref">E </span>Inference</span></a>
<ol class="ltx_toclist ltx_toclist_appendix">
