<article class="ltx_document ltx_authors_1line">
<h1 class="ltx_title ltx_title_document">
LeRobot: An Open-Source Library for 
<br class="ltx_break">End-to-End Robot Learning
</h1>
<div class="ltx_authors">
<span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Remi Cadene<sup id="id1" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">Hugging Face 
<br class="ltx_break">&amp;Simon Aliberts<sup id="id2" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">Hugging Face 
<br class="ltx_break">&amp;Francesco Capuano<sup id="id3" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> <sup id="id4" class="ltx_sup">†</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">University of Oxford 
<br class="ltx_break">&amp;Michel Aractingi<sup id="id5" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">Hugging Face 
<br class="ltx_break">&amp;Adil Zouitine<sup id="id6" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">Hugging Face 
<br class="ltx_break">&amp;Pepijn Kooijmans<sup id="id7" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">Hugging Face 
<br class="ltx_break">&amp;Jade Choghari<sup id="id8" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">Hugging Face 
<br class="ltx_break">&amp;Martino Russi<sup id="id9" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">Hugging Face 
<br class="ltx_break">&amp;Caroline Pascal<sup id="id10" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">Hugging Face 
<br class="ltx_break">&amp;Steven Palma<sup id="id11" class="ltx_sup">*</sup> 
<br class="ltx_break">Hugging Face 
